// converted to this format; ions, deuterated species, inert copies and reactants without
// coefficients left out; species split over two records joined; eleven first intervals
// the 2021 revision turned inside out (lower bound 300 K above the upper) start at 200 K
// again, as before it; wüstite's iron 0.947, as its name and data have it (its record's
